---
description: Vitest conventions for a published library
globs: ["test/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.test.ts"]
---
Testing rules for this package:
- One test file per source module, mirroring the path (`src/foo.ts` → `test/foo.test.ts`).
- Test exported behavior, not internals; use the public API in tests.
- Deterministic: fake timers, seeded randomness, temp dirs for fs, no real network.
- Table-driven tests for edge cases (empty, unicode, max sizes, invalid input).
- Never merge below coverage thresholds; run `pnpm test:coverage` for changed code.
- Bug fixes start with a failing regression test that reproduces the bug.
